<item><title>Burkina Faso starts unique-ID enrolment for education staff</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-starts-unique-id-enrolment-for-education-staff-b054d9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-starts-unique-id-enrolment-for-education-staff-b054d9/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>Education Minister Jacques Sosthène Dingara enrolled himself in Ouagadougou as his ministry began registering administrative staff and teachers.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:30:07 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso schedules 11 December parade after five-year pause</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-schedules-11-december-parade-after-five-year-2ee341/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-schedules-11-december-parade-after-five-year-2ee341/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The independence celebration will include a military and paramilitary parade in Ouagadougou, which organisers describe as unprecedented in scale.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:19:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso charges four over 577.48 grams of missing cocaine</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-charges-four-over-577-48-grams-of-missing-4644f3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-charges-four-over-577-48-grams-of-missing-4644f3/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>A court clerk and a prison security officer are among those accused of taking and selling cocaine kept as evidence for destruction after trial.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 22:07:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso requires special permits for dozens of key imports and exports</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-requires-special-permits-for-dozens-of-key-7fb9ba/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-requires-special-permits-for-dozens-of-key-7fb9ba/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>A decree signed on October 30 requires prior authorization for trading staple foods like rice and maize, as well as strategic commodities including gold and cotton.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:47:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-requires-special-permits-for-dozens-of-key-7fb9ba/share.jpg" length="42594" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-requires-special-permits-for-dozens-of-key-7fb9ba/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Vexdrone wins Burkina Faso&apos;s Orange Summer Challenge with drone inspection tool</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/vexdrone-wins-burkina-faso-s-orange-summer-challenge-with-be9bd0/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/vexdrone-wins-burkina-faso-s-orange-summer-challenge-with-be9bd0/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The Ouagadougou team&apos;s system uses drones to detect faults in electrical installations and won equipment valued at four million CFA francs.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:45:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
